o be made out  of darkness or shadows  asta is shocked to see this and soar the  captains  in fact osta seems to suggest that these  four shadow monsters are four separate  devils implying that nacht might not be  possessed by a single demon or devil  but by multiple maybe even as many as  five  if we count the little one on his  shoulder as a separate demon  now i am not jumping to conclusions on  this  just yet i think there might be a  translation  issue or osta might just have the  impression that these are all  separate devils we have to remember that  nacht uses  shadow magic so these creatures could be  creations  of the shadow magic itself i don't know  it just seems crazy to me that one  person could be possessed by  five separate demons it just doesn't add  up from what we've seen so far  but if it were true it would be an  absolute game changer  a person who is possessed by one devil  is overpowered enough but a human who is  possessed  by five would be absolutely broken  as everyone is still confused about  nacht and his magic  noct smiles and says that he has a right  to be here  and julius confirms this pointing out  that this is the vice captain  of the black bulls julius says that he  didn't realize that nacht was possessed  by a devil  but he was aware of him and he knew that  he had infiltrated the spade kingdom  as a spy the very fact that julius the  guy who is the most curious  about magic in the entire kingdom did  not know the true nature of nacht's  magic  is in itself insane and as jack thinks  about it he realized that he has seen  nacht  once before it seems that yami and nacht  have actually known each other for a  long time  and it looks like they were both members  of the azure deer squad  at the same time back before yami became  the black bull's captain  even though everyone in the room is  still stunned and confused about  knocked knocked doesn't waste any time  he quickly goes on to explain the dark  and terrifying truth about the dark  triad and the fate  of william and yami as we all know  the dark triad is planning to use the  tree of clifforth to open a  portal between this world and the demon  world a portal which will be located  inside the spade kingdom and which will  allow countless demons to freely enter  this world if the plan succeeds the  result  will be mass destruction and the  annihilation of  90 percent of the world's population  what's more in order to open the tree of  cliffhoth  the dark triad will need to sacrifice  yami and william  once the ritual begins there are only 7  days  before it is completed at which point  both yami  and william will be killed seven gates  must be opened in order for the two  worlds to connect and presumably one  gate must be opened  every day over the course of 7 days but  if that  wasn't enough at the location where this  ritual is set to take place  there are apparently 10 different devils  who are coordinating the tree of  clifford  ritual the weakest demons are at the top  and the strongest ones are  at the bottom from the illustration that  we see there appear to be nine levels  to the tree of cliffhoth which is  identical to the nine circles of hell  in dante's inferno there are two demons  on the top level  and then one each on the other eight  levels  the ones at the top are about as strong  as the members of the dark triad  and the one at the very bottom is  lucifer or lucifero  himself lucifer is of course dante's  demon  and this implies that dante's demon is  in fact the strongest out of all of them  in dante's inferno not the dante from  black clover but the dante who was an  italian writer but you get the reference  lucifer himself is trapped in the center  of the ninth circle of hell  which by the way is a frozen wasteland  so it seems to me that the tree of  cliffhoth  is in fact a direct reference to dante's  inferno  nacht says that the bad news is that  yami and william will be killed as part  of this ritual  but the good news is that they won't be  killed until the very end of the ritual  so there is still some time to rescue  them real wonders  why the dark triad would want to do  something as horrible and dangerous as  connecting this world and the demon  world  but noct explains that the triad doesn't  care about  reason or logic they are psychos who  like to cause pain  for its own sake and they feel no sense  of guilt whatsoever for making  other people suffer so essentially they  are psychotic agents of chaos without a  conscience  and nacht says that he hates people like  that most of all  then in a rare moment of seriousness for  an otherwise always cheerful and smiling  knocked  the black bull vice captain says that  even if god  or the devil forgives the dark triad he  will not forgive them this seems to  suggest  that this whole situation is somehow  personal for knocked  and that he might have a deeply  emotional reason for wanting to destroy  the dark triad it could just be the noct  is actually really close friends with  yami and he is angry at them for  capturing him  even though he claims to hate yami  publicly or there might be something  else going on here that we still don't  know about  after all noct's entire backstory is a  complete mystery to us  so who knows what dark secrets the vice  captain  is still hiding but as strong and  determined as nacht clearly is  he realizes that he simply cannot defeat  the dark triad and all those demons  on his own so he has decided to make  asta  as strong as possible because anti-magic  is the key to defeating the dark triad  once and for all knocked then  explains what their mission is and man  what a crazy  and dangerous mission they only have a  few days to rescue yami and william  before the tree of cliffhoth is opened  and the entire world  is destroyed in order to prevent the  ritual from being completed  they must create an elite tactical force  that will be able to infiltrate the  spade kingdom while protecting asta  